<title>UK: SOCCER SHOWCASE-NEWCASTLE INSTALLED AS TITLE FAVOURITES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER SHOWCASE-NEWCASTLE INSTALLED AS TITLE FAVOURITES.</headline>
<dateline>NEWCASTLE, England 1996-11-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newcastle were installed as 11-10 favourites for the English premier league title after their 3-1 win over Middlesbrough on Sunday.</p>
<p>Liverpool, beaten 3-0 at Blackburn, have drifted out to 2-1, with Manchester United 7-2.</p>
